Error [jet.ReservedDunderName]: `__TablePlan` is reserved for Jet
  --> tests/ui/dataflow_stream/query_plan_private_nominal_cannot_be_named_by_user_code_2.jet:2:24
    |
  2 | hidden: fn(value: data.__TablePlan) {}
    |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Double-underscore names belong to the compiler, generated binders, debugger, serializer, and tools
 Fix: Rename it without the second leading underscore
